{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json",
  "name": "dfdl",
  "homepage": "https://dfdl-ui.fernandezdelaradylan.workers.dev",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "tokens",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "dfdl tokens",
      "description": "The dfdl design tokens: OKLCH primitives and semantics, light and dark, two approved accents, quiet mode. tokens.css for Tailwind v4 projects; tokens.hsl.css (HSL channel triples) for Tailwind v3. Generated from decisions in dylanfernandezdelara/dfdl-ui.",
      "author": "Dylan Fernandez de Lara",
      "categories": [
        "foundations"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "src/styles/tokens.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "styles/dfdl/tokens.css"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/styles/tokens.hsl.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "styles/dfdl/tokens.hsl.css"
        }
      ],
      "docs": "Import styles/dfdl/tokens.css from your global CSS. Tailwind v3: point theme colors at hsl(var(--hsl-bg-page) / <alpha-value>) from tokens.hsl.css. Tailwind v4: install https://dfdl-ui.fernandezdelaradylan.workers.dev/r/theme.json instead."
    },
    {
      "name": "theme",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "dfdl theme",
      "description": "Tokens, the Tailwind v4 mapping and motion utilities, and cn configured with the dfdl vocabulary. Install this before any component.",
      "author": "Dylan Fernandez de Lara",
      "categories": [
        "foundations"
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "cn",
        "tw-animate-css"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "src/styles/tokens.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "styles/dfdl/tokens.css"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/styles/theme.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "styles/dfdl/theme.css"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/lib/utils.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib"
        }
      ],
      "docs": "Replace the contents of your global CSS with: @import \"tailwindcss\"; @import \"tw-animate-css\"; @import \"../styles/dfdl/tokens.css\"; @import \"../styles/dfdl/theme.css\"; The theme maps shadcn's color names, and the block shadcn init wrote would override it. Load Lora with next/font as --font-lora. Set the accent on <html data-accent=\"ember\"> or \"indigo\"."
    },
    {
      "name": "probes",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "dfdl probes",
      "description": "Browser probes that measure the result: grid alignment, inline baseline alignment, and running animations. Paste into the console or run with agent-browser eval.",
      "author": "Dylan Fernandez de Lara",
      "categories": [
        "tooling"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "scripts/probes/grid.js",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "~/scripts/probes/grid.js"
        },
        {
          "path": "scripts/probes/animations.js",
          "type": "registry:file",
